==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_Reload_Silk.svg|32px]] '''Silk Reload_Silk''' command reloads the Silk workbench (specifically, just its core library) without exiting FreeCAD, after making code changes.

==Usage==

# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_Reload_Silk.svg|16px]] Reload_Silk}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_Reload_Silk.svg|16px]] Reload_Silk}} option from the menu.


